# The Under from the Rob chapter save (pokemon-colosseum.3641.gci, Agate
# Pokemon Center, Under opening flags 0x43E-0x446 set) through Venus, the
# subway trainers, the Subway Key and the train ride to the Shadow Pokemon
# Lab and back. Played by tests/test_story_route.c; battles are reported as
# result 2 (win). No flag is written by this route: every expect is set by an
# original script.
#
# Venus's house (0x37), arriving from the Under (0x2F).
floor 0x37 0 0x2f
talk 3
expect 0x44a 1
expect 0x44c 1
# Subway B1 and B2 (0x39, 0x3A): four trainers open the way down.
floor 0x39 0
floor 0x3a 0
talk 1
talk 2
talk 3
talk 4
expect 0x44e 1
# Subway B3 (0x3C): Venus's sequence clears the roadblock.
floor 0x3c 0
expect 0x44f 1
# Train (0x3D): its door goes back to B3 while the train is on the Under side.
floor 0x3d 0
expect 0x450 1
door 0
expect_floor 0x3c
expect 0xafb 1
# Back on B2: the Subway Key (item 0x1FC) is treasure row 45, shown after
# 0xAFB; picking it up sets 0xC4.
floor 0x3a 0
press -76.57 -50.67 180 0
expect 0xc4 1
